  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "八老爺車頭"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>作者：蘇晏德</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2019年12月18</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">時日teh-beh到冬節</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">下晡踏chiūⁿ八老爺ê土地</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kā鐵枝路當做大街</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">恬靜tī chia lin-long-se̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">孤單一人tī車頭坐</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">日頭探頭kā我行禮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">歡迎我　唯一ê過客</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">八老爺啥時變chiâⁿ八翁里</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">八老爺村地名真趣味</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">八翁里感覺chiok怪奇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">改名到底為啥mi̍h？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">今仔日kánn-ná m̄是12月天</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">鼻無寒天ê滋味</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">只賰淡薄涼涼ê秋意</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">微微仔風對我笑bi-bi</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">親像leh講八老爺ê過去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">車頭關門無營業ê日子</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">奶牛啥人kā你飼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">賰我一人陪伴--你</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">專欄，</span><span><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">。</b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報322期，2021年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi